{"type":"text","timestamp":1794529978509,"sessionID":"ses_e2dafa57effeO4wwa27i0dv11O","part":{"id":"prt_1d2525d29002DhM9VLMxnZSLOT","sessionID":"ses_e2dafa57effeO4wwa27i0dv11O","messageID":"msg_1d2525646001Sk63tVJ5C0vFSM","type":"text","text":"T023 complete.\n\n**File written**\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/README.md` (only file touched)\n  - New `### Attribution on every run line` subsection: `offeredCommand`, `offeredPolicy`, `briefDelivered`, and that the offer is a replay of the Claude prompt hook after the turn, with `offerError` values `hook_missing`, `hook_failed`, `no_head`.\n  - New `### Backfill a finished log` subsection: `--backfill <run-log> --out <new-log>`, refusals `same_path`, `holdout_row`, `unknown_row`, missing `--out`, and the `no_checkout` line behaviour.\n  - `## 4. STRUCTURE`: updated the `score-command-transcripts.mjs` row with `offered`, `startedOfOffered`, `offerUnknown`, `cappedStartRows`, `armIncomplete`, `byPolicy`; added a `command-offer.mjs` row; updated the `run-command-behaviour.mjs` row with the backfill mode.\n  - `## 6. USAGE EXAMPLES`: added a backfill example naming its outputs and refusal codes.\n\n**Verify output**\n```\n$ rg -c \"offeredCommand|--backfill|armIncomplete|byPolicy|cappedStartRows\" .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/README.md\n6\n```\n6 is at least 5, so the check passes. Added lines contain no em dash, semicolon, spec path or task id.\n\n**Not done**\n- T023's checkbox in `tasks.md` was left unticked, as instructed.\n- No test files were run; the task named none. Nothing was blocked.","time":{"start":1794529975593,"end":1794529978509}}}
